# The scrapwood over the shoulder: its most characteristic floor at noon and in
# the evening, then beside a scrap tree; then the machine city at noon, in the
# evening and at night. With the frame cost standing at noon in each.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/lands_scrap.tour --seed=7 --weather=clear:0 --view=shoulder --stats
coast calm
hour 12
place typical_scrapwood
wait 3.0
shot scrap-noon with land:scrapwood
perf stats begin
wait 5.0
perf stats end scrap-noon
hour 18.5
wait 2.0
shot scrap-evening with land:scrapwood
hour 12
near scrap_tree
wait 2.5
shot scrap-tree with prop:scrap_tree
place typical_machine_city
wait 3.0
shot city-noon with land:machine_city
perf stats begin
wait 5.0
perf stats end city-noon
hour 18.5
wait 2.0
shot city-evening with land:machine_city
hour 22.5
wait 2.0
shot city-night with land:machine_city
